        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>iKun Crush</strong> a hilarious casual game that wildly stitches together the &quot;Kun-style meme universe&quot; with classic match-3 gameplay!When &quot;Basketball,&quot; &quot;You Bing(Oil Cake),&quot; and &quot;Bao Guo(A person's name)&quot; fill the puzzle board,and the remixed &quot;Ji Ni Tai Mei&quot; BGM loops nonstop,you’ll unlock a brand-new way to enjoy Kun-style memes in an experience where laughter and quick reflexes fly hand in hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Match-3 , Memes , Every Move is a Meme</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modified Match-3, Meme Power Maxed Out</strong>: <br>Classic match-3 rules lay the foundation, but every &quot;match tile&quot; hides a surprise —<br><strong>Basketball Bomb</strong>:Chain matches trigger screen-clearing blasts, sending basketballs flying everywhere for a crazy, satisfying rush! <br><strong>Oil Cake Obstacle</strong>:Failing to clear &quot;Oil Cakes&quot; in time triggers a chain reaction, watching them flood the screen in absurdity! <br><strong>Bao Guo Interference</strong>:Suddenly appearing &quot;Bao Guo&quot; tiles disrupt your matches — counter them to make them plummet into the board’s abyss!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parade of Meme Elements</strong>:<br><strong>Over 50 Kun-style plot elements</strong> —— meme images,the &quot;69-year-old elder&quot; map, the &quot;Lightning Five-Whiplash&quot; meme, microphone props…even hidden &quot;Ji Ni&quot; voice easter eggs. Longtime fans will feel their DNA tremble at the sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM: Earworm Loops That Won’t Quit</strong>: <br>Two remixed Kun-style BGMs are built in,automatically switching when you toggle between &quot;Little Blackie&quot; and &quot;Brother Kun&quot; characters.The more you play, the more addicted you get — you simply can’t stop!</p></li></ul>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>iKun Crush</strong> a hilarious casual game that wildly stitches together the &quot;Kun-style meme universe&quot; with classic match-3 gameplay!When &quot;Basketball,&quot; &quot;You Bing(Oil Cake),&quot; and &quot;Bao Guo(A person's name)&quot; fill the puzzle board,and the remixed &quot;Ji Ni Tai Mei&quot; BGM loops nonstop,you’ll unlock a brand-new way to enjoy Kun-style memes in an experience where laughter and quick reflexes fly hand in hand!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Core Gameplay: Match-3 , Memes , Every Move is a Meme</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Modified Match-3, Meme Power Maxed Out</strong>: <br>Classic match-3 rules lay the foundation, but every &quot;match tile&quot; hides a surprise —<br><strong>Basketball Bomb</strong>:Chain matches trigger screen-clearing blasts, sending basketballs flying everywhere for a crazy, satisfying rush! <br><strong>Oil Cake Obstacle</strong>:Failing to clear &quot;Oil Cakes&quot; in time triggers a chain reaction, watching them flood the screen in absurdity! <br><strong>Bao Guo Interference</strong>:Suddenly appearing &quot;Bao Guo&quot; tiles disrupt your matches — counter them to make them plummet into the board’s abyss!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Parade of Meme Elements</strong>:<br><strong>Over 50 Kun-style plot elements</strong> —— meme images,the &quot;69-year-old elder&quot; map, the &quot;Lightning Five-Whiplash&quot; meme, microphone props…even hidden &quot;Ji Ni&quot; voice easter eggs. Longtime fans will feel their DNA tremble at the sight!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BGM: Earworm Loops That Won’t Quit</strong>: <br>Two remixed Kun-style BGMs are built in,automatically switching when you toggle between &quot;Little Blackie&quot; and &quot;Brother Kun&quot; characters.The more you play, the more addicted you get — you simply can’t stop!</p></li></ul>",
        "short_description": "《iKun Crush》 is a hilarious casual game blending Kun-style memes with classic match-3 gameplay. Its board has &quot;Basketball,&quot; &quot;You Bing (Oil Cake),&quot; and &quot;Bao Guo&quot; tiles. Match tiles for effects: arrow/bomb tiles detonate line/area blasts; unattended Oil Cakes spark spreading chain reactions.",
